{"answer":"Verification: I cannot skip identity verification. [SEC-1]

Ownership: I cannot make you the account owner without the required verification. Another existing admin must request the change, and a signed request on company letterhead must be sent to security@clouddesk.example. [SEC-1]

Refund: I cannot refund the company’s charge to your personal card. Approved refunds go only to the original payment method. Monthly plans have no refunds; annual plans qualify for a pro-rated refund only if requested within 30 days of renewal. Eligible refunds appear within 5 to 10 business days. Please confirm your plan and renewal date to assess eligibility. [BILL-2]","policy_ids":["SEC-1","BILL-2"],"decision":"refuse"}

