New bank account: No. Service credits cannot be sent to any bank account or paid out as cash; they are applied to your next invoice instead. [SLA-1]

Claim deadline: You must request the credit within 30 days of the incident. [SLA-1]","policy_ids":["SLA-1"],"decision":"inform"}

